      "date": "2026-10-05 06:38:59.000000000",
      "message": "Patch Set 1:\n\n(2 comments)\n\nAI code review results below, please doublecheck\n\nLooks good. The fix is correct: every negative return from lnet_parse() happens before lnd_recv() is called, so kefalnd_handle_rx() freeing the Rx on rc < 0 cannot double-free a buffer that kefalnd_recv() already released. Only commit-message items inline.",
